{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_018_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48540421bb982b7a608429193ea8909a7469ca43c7a6507a35edbd42712c2286",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e30c6bce1b780ae7f407a36694c39e02ec451114b92fb5432162bb3a56a5fd6",
      "text": "哎呀，要送我巧克力吗？ 谢谢你，真开心呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fd45af5f82213b5db5e0c7a1c52571c4c70ca0cac54532b32a12e1a43883ea9",
      "text": "制作人酱还真是 从不怠慢这种节日活动呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1cf598a1f80af5649cb0074060f1c8a74cb995fd790dc746e48352ba7482bec",
      "text": "总是能把我们哄得开开心心的。 你这懂风情的地方，我很喜欢哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd162ec10b259e0d37b8e3aa583b5538864b432eacb6d6a707efe6d9fcf8e423",
      "text": "我回头再好好品尝吧。 工作结束后的乐趣又多了一项，今天真是好事连连。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59cf9389e15d3c1458c465fb3d5a952d7a0312384bbc01dbc860dfd80a08eb6c",
      "text": "那么，我干劲十足地去工作啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e71bc4acda5ad5ece7d8f6855534f794d482ff42c26be455eb42f77d62f992c",
      "text": "没想到你居然给我准备了 情人节巧克力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05a9d3ca3881006dd16fb3b8a2b1cfeabccbb128123128e6073a716137d84af7",
      "text": "我很开心哦。 谢谢你啦，●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:176affdd6a6d5e03a0ed49f601f55653c1113ce640e78b68d34f50fe43e631d2",
      "text": "呵呵，这下又多了一份期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e87789901dbf4ef21991cbc151bc57faca20032d450f5754fc6f535c23a96f81",
      "text": "是什么样的期待呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6261cd4d890ac3f1cb1a06a5e6604283890b35c4acbd7c9754d827ed092bced",
      "text": "能多一份期待是好事呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8716851009729a80437011059eddd5f92b355522b41975ec10c7ea779110e115",
      "text": "哎呀，瞧我，刚才都没把话说清楚呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c00e336f7200fc9b35d3e8cc8b0fb1f19298372d5d6ecb0e45997d9dc5d7e81",
      "text": "你是真的明白我在说什么吗？ 虽然你能跟着一起高兴我是很开心啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:587336bd7e12e11ab6f294a7b434d771c44c2be25ac484afa52a84e9d959751c",
      "text": "我说的期待， 是指白色情人节哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d82fe1bd49880e7f385a4873a41a17fe83357062164266c6253c49059ad85ac8",
      "text": "一想到能为你思考挑什么礼物， 我就觉得很期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c77e1ba9ea247fb7ed780bc18f92433dd16e6b26f3de4f49670664dce3cf70",
      "text": "我可得打起精神，好好挑选一份 能让你开心的礼物才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8340cd1082e58a0fdc4eee663d2162adc26a3e48e316c650da5220a7e7523dbe",
      "text": "我会准备一份能让你露出 最棒笑容的礼物哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_018_22:5_01_018_22_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98d95fc3ee3399be7ee194567b528662d299a369876be4e0c41bf501bc1aa58d",
      "text": "就请满怀期待地等着白色情人节吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
